The '''Snow-Time Cosmetic Pack''' is an active [[Gamepass]] featuring 5 exclusive skins regarding the [[Christmas Toons]] and {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}} in [[Dandy's World]]. It was introduced in [[Changelog|v0.14.1]] as the fourth Gamepass available in [[Dandy's Store]].

==Effect==
Players who purchased this gamepass are rewarded 600 [[Ichor]] and receive the 5 matching skins for {{CI|Bobette|name=true}}, {{CI|Coal|name=true}}, {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}}, {{CI|Ginger|name=true}}, and {{CI|Rudie|name=true}}.

